var essays = [{"id":1,"year":"2020","type":"书信","title":"给外国朋友写一封介绍中国传统节日的信","prompt":"假设你是李华，你的美国朋友Tom对中国文化很感兴趣。请给他写一封英文信，介绍一个你最喜欢的中国传统节日（如春节、中秋节）。要点：1.节日名称和时间；2.人们如何庆祝；3.你最喜欢它的原因。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"假设你是李华，你的美国朋友汤姆对中国文化很感兴趣。请给他写一封英文信，介绍一个你最喜欢的中国传统节日（如春节、中秋节）。要点：1.节日名称和时间；2.人们如何庆祝；3.你最喜欢它的原因。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Tom,\n\nI'm glad to hear that you are interested in Chinese culture. I'd like to introduce the Spring Festival to you, which is the most important festival in China.\n\nThe Spring Festival usually falls in January or February. Before it comes, families clean their houses and put up red couplets on doors. On New Year's Eve, all family members get together to enjoy a big dinner, such as dumplings and fish. Children are the happiest because they can receive red envelopes with lucky money. At midnight, fireworks light up the sky.\n\nWhat I like most about the festival is the family reunion. It is a time when people working far away return home. No matter how busy we are, we always try to get together.\n\nI hope you can come to China and experience the festival with us.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的汤姆：\n\n很高兴听说你对中国文化感兴趣。我想向你介绍春节，它是中国最重要的节日。\n\n春节通常在1月或2月。在春节到来之前，家家户户打扫房屋，在门上贴红对联。除夕夜，全家人聚在一起享用丰盛的晚餐，比如饺子和鱼。孩子们最开心，因为他们能收到装有压岁钱的红包。午夜时分，烟花照亮了天空。\n\n这个节日我最喜欢的是家人团聚。这是在外工作的人们回家的时候。无论多忙，我们总会设法聚在一起。\n\n希望你能来中国，和我们一起体验这个节日。\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["书信格式完整：称呼、正文、结尾、署名","要点齐全：节日时间、庆祝方式、喜爱原因","使用连接词：Before... / On New Year's Eve / At midnight / No matter how","句型多样：定语从句which is...、主语从句What I like most...、让步状语No matter how..."]},{"id":2,"year":"2020","type":"议论文","title":"论大学生参加社会实践的重要性","prompt":"越来越多的大学生利用假期参加社会实践。请以The Importance of Social Practice为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.社会实践的好处；2.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"越来越多的大学生利用假期参加社会实践。请以《社会实践的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.社会实践的好处；2.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Social Practice\n\nNowadays, more and more college students take part in social practice during their holidays. In my opinion, social practice is of great importance to college students.\n\nTo begin with, social practice helps us connect what we learn in class with real life. Knowledge from textbooks is often abstract, while social practice offers us the chance to put it into use. For instance, a computer science student can improve his programming skills by working as an intern in a company. Furthermore, social practice can improve our ability to communicate and cooperate with others, which is essential for our future career. Last but not least, it helps us understand society better and makes us more responsible.\n\nIn conclusion, social practice is not only a way to gain experience but also a valuable lesson for life. We should seize every opportunity to take part in it.","essay_cn":"社会实践的重要性\n\n如今，越来越多的大学生利用假期参加社会实践。在我看来，社会实践对大学生非常重要。\n\n首先，社会实践帮助我们将在课堂上学到的知识与现实生活联系起来。课本知识往往是抽象的，而社会实践给了我们将其付诸实践的机会。例如，计算机专业的学生可以通过在公司实习来提高编程技能。此外，社会实践能提高我们与他人沟通合作的能力，这对我们未来的职业至关重要。最后但同样重要的是，它帮助我们更好地了解社会，使我们更有责任感。\n\n总之，社会实践不仅是获得经验的方式，也是人生宝贵的一课。我们应该抓住每一个机会参加社会实践。","points":["观点型议论文：亮明观点→分点论证→总结升华","论证层次：To begin with / Furthermore / Last but not least","结合专业举例（计算机专业学生实习）贴近考生实际","结尾提升：not only... but also... 双重视角"]},{"id":3,"year":"2020","type":"应用文","title":"写一份关于举办校园读书节的通知","prompt":"学校将于下月举办校园读书节，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.活动目的和时间；2.活动内容（好书推荐、读书分享会、征文比赛）；3.报名方式。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"学校将于下月举办校园读书节，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.活动目的和时间；2.活动内容（好书推荐、读书分享会、征文比赛）；3.报名方式。词数100左右。","essay":"NOTICE\n\nIn order to encourage students to read more and develop good reading habits, the Student Union will hold a Campus Reading Festival next month.\n\nThe festival will last for two weeks, from May 10th to May 24th. During this period, a series of colorful activities will be arranged, such as a book recommendation corner, reading-sharing sessions and an essay contest on \"The Book That Changed Me\". All students are warmly welcome to take part in these activities.\n\nThose who are interested in the essay contest are required to hand in their articles to the Student Union office before May 18th. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us at studentunion@school.edu.cn.\n\nWe are looking forward to your active participation!\n\nThe Student Union","essay_cn":"通知\n\n为鼓励同学们多读书、养成良好阅读习惯，学生会将于下月举办校园读书节。\n\n读书节将持续两周，从5月10日到5月24日。在此期间将安排一系列丰富多彩的活动，如好书推荐角、读书分享会和以「改变我的一本书」为主题的征文比赛。欢迎全体同学踊跃参加。\n\n有意参加征文比赛的同学须在5月18日前将文章交到学生会办公室。如有任何疑问，请随时通过 studentunion@school.edu.cn 与我们联系。\n\n期待大家的积极参与！\n\n学生会","points":["通知格式：标题NOTICE、正文、落款","开头说明目的（In order to...）","时间地点清晰，活动内容用such as列举","结尾表达期待：We are looking forward to your active participation"]},{"id":4,"year":"2020","type":"书信","title":"感谢信：感谢老师的帮助","prompt":"你在英语学习中遇到困难，英语老师王老师耐心帮助你。请给王老师写一封感谢信。要点：1.表达感谢；2.回忆老师帮助你的具体事例；3.表达决心和祝福。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你在英语学习中遇到困难，英语老师王老师耐心帮助你。请给王老师写一封感谢信。要点：1.表达感谢；2.回忆老师帮助你的具体事例；3.表达决心和祝福。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Miss Wang,\n\nI am writing to express my sincere gratitude for your patient help with my English study.\n\nLast term, I had great difficulty in English, especially in writing and listening. Whenever I turned to you for help, you always explained the problems to me with great patience. What impressed me most was that you spent your spare time correcting my compositions and encouraging me not to give up. Thanks to your help, I have made great progress in English and become more confident than before.\n\nI will work even harder and never let you down. I hope you can have a happy life and good health.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的王老师：\n\n我写信向您表达真诚的感谢，感谢您在我英语学习上耐心的帮助。\n\n上学期，我在英语方面遇到了很大困难，尤其是在写作和听力方面。每当我向您求助时，您总是非常耐心地为我讲解问题。最令我印象深刻的是，您用课余时间批改我的作文，并鼓励我不要放弃。多亏了您的帮助，我的英语取得了很大进步，也变得更加自信了。\n\n我会更加努力学习，绝不辜负您的期望。祝您生活幸福、身体健康。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["感谢信要点：直接表达感谢→具体事例→决心与祝福","强调句型：What impressed me most was that...","因果表达：Thanks to your help...","结尾表态：work even harder and never let you down"]},{"id":5,"year":"2020","type":"应用文","title":"写一封求职信应聘暑期兼职","prompt":"一家英语培训机构招聘暑期兼职助教，请你写一封英文求职信应聘该职位。要点：1.应聘职位；2.个人优势（英语水平、沟通能力、相关经验）；3.表达期望。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"一家英语培训机构招聘暑期兼职助教，请你写一封英文求职信应聘该职位。要点：1.应聘职位；2.个人优势（英语水平、沟通能力、相关经验）；3.表达期望。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nI am writing to apply for the position of part-time teaching assistant advertised in your training center.\n\nI am a junior college student majoring in Computer Science. I have passed CET-4 and my spoken English is quite good. What's more, I am patient, responsible and good at communicating with others. Last summer, I worked as a volunteer tutor in a primary school, where I helped children with their English homework. This experience taught me how to get along well with students.\n\nI believe I am qualified for this position. I am available from July to August. I would appreciate it if you could give me an opportunity for an interview.\n\nLooking forward to your early reply.\n\nYours faithfully,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的先生或女士：\n\n我写信申请贵培训中心广告中招聘的兼职助教职位。\n\n我是一名计算机科学专业的专科生。我已通过大学英语四级考试，英语口语相当不错。此外，我耐心、负责、善于与人沟通。去年暑假，我在一所小学担任志愿者辅导员，帮助孩子们完成英语作业。这段经历教会了我如何与学生相处。\n\n我相信我能胜任这个职位。我7月到8月都有空。如果您能给我一个面试机会，我将不胜感激。\n\n期待您的早日回复。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["求职信结构：表明目的→自我介绍与优势→表达期望","优势用递进：have passed CET-4 / What's more / good at","用实例证明能力（志愿者辅导经历）","礼貌请求：I would appreciate it if you could..."]},{"id":6,"year":"2021","type":"议论文","title":"手机对学习的影响","prompt":"如今手机在大学生中非常普及。请以The Influence of Mobile Phones on Study为题写一篇英语短文，论述手机对学习的利与弊，并给出你的建议。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"如今手机在大学生中非常普及。请以《手机对学习的影响》为题写一篇英语短文，论述手机对学习的利与弊，并给出你的建议。词数120左右。","essay":"The Influence of Mobile Phones on Study\n\nWith the rapid development of technology, mobile phones have become an indispensable part of college students' daily life. They bring both convenience and problems to our study.\n\nOn the one hand, mobile phones make learning more convenient. Students can look up information, watch online courses and use learning apps anywhere at any time. For example, when we meet difficult words in reading, we can check them immediately with a dictionary app.\n\nOn the other hand, mobile phones can be a great distraction. Many students spend too much time on games, short videos and social media, which wastes a lot of valuable time. As a result, some students can hardly concentrate on their lessons.\n\nIn my opinion, mobile phones are a double-edged sword. We should make good use of them and learn to control ourselves. Only in this way can we truly benefit from them.","essay_cn":"手机对学习的影响\n\n随着科技的快速发展，手机已成为大学生日常生活中不可或缺的一部分。它给我们的学习既带来了便利，也带来了问题。\n\n一方面，手机让学习更加便捷。学生可以在任何时间任何地点查阅资料、观看网络课程、使用学习应用。例如，当阅读中遇到生词时，我们可以立即用词典应用查询。\n\n另一方面，手机可能成为巨大的干扰。许多学生在游戏、短视频和社交媒体上花费太多时间，浪费了大量宝贵时间。结果，一些学生几乎无法专心听课。\n\n在我看来，手机是一把双刃剑。我们应该善加利用它，并学会控制自己。只有这样，我们才能真正从中受益。","points":["总分总结构：引入→利弊对比→个人观点","过渡词清晰：On the one hand / On the other hand / As a result / In my opinion","举例支撑论点（生词查词典）","结尾倒装句Only in this way can we... 提升档次"]},{"id":7,"year":"2021","type":"书信","title":"邀请信：邀请外教参加英语晚会","prompt":"你是学生会主席李华，学校下周五晚将举办英语晚会。请给外教Mr. Smith写一封邀请信。要点：1.时间和地点；2.活动内容（歌曲、戏剧、朗诵等）；3.希望他参加并表演节目。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你是学生会主席李华，学校下周五晚将举办英语晚会。请给外教史密斯先生写一封邀请信。要点：1.时间和地点；2.活动内容（歌曲、戏剧、朗诵等）；3.希望他参加并表演节目。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Mr. Smith,\n\nOn behalf of the Student Union, I am writing to invite you to our English Evening Party.\n\nThe party will be held in the school auditorium at 7:00 p.m. next Friday. There will be various wonderful performances, including English songs, short plays, poem recitation and dancing. We have also prepared some interesting games for everyone.\n\nWe would be greatly honored if you could join us. Moreover, if you could prepare a program, such as an English song or a speech, the party would be even more wonderful. All the students are looking forward to seeing your performance.\n\nWould you be kind enough to let us know whether you can come? We sincerely hope you can make it.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的史密斯先生：\n\n我谨代表学生会写信邀请您参加我们的英语晚会。\n\n晚会将于下周五晚上7点在学校礼堂举行。届时将有各种精彩的表演，包括英语歌曲、短剧、诗歌朗诵和舞蹈。我们还为大家准备了一些有趣的游戏。\n\n如果您能参加，我们将深感荣幸。此外，如果您能准备一个节目，比如一首英文歌或一次演讲，晚会将更加精彩。所有学生都期待看到您的表演。\n\n能否请您告知我们您是否能来？我们真诚希望您能参加。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["邀请信五要素：表明身份、活动信息、发出邀请、期待回复","礼貌用语：On behalf of / be greatly honored / look forward to","活动内容用including列举丰富细节","结尾委婉请求回复：Would you be kind enough to..."]},{"id":8,"year":"2021","type":"议论文","title":"网络学习的利与弊","prompt":"随着互联网的发展，网络学习越来越普遍。请以Online Learning为题写一篇英语短文，谈谈网络学习的优缺点。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"随着互联网的发展，网络学习越来越普遍。请以《网络学习》为题写一篇英语短文，谈谈网络学习的优缺点。词数120左右。","essay":"Online Learning\n\nWith the rapid development of the Internet, online learning has become more and more popular among students. However, it has both advantages and disadvantages.\n\nTo begin with, online learning is very convenient and flexible. Students can attend classes at home without going to school, which saves a lot of time on the road. Besides, there are rich learning resources on the Internet. We can choose whatever courses we are interested in and learn at our own pace.\n\nNevertheless, online learning also has some disadvantages. For one thing, it requires strong self-discipline. Without the supervision of teachers, some students may play games or watch videos instead of studying. For another, staring at the screen for a long time is bad for our eyes, and we lack face-to-face communication with teachers and classmates.\n\nIn conclusion, online learning is a useful tool but not a perfect one. We should take advantage of its benefits while avoiding its drawbacks.","essay_cn":"网络学习\n\n随着互联网的快速发展，网络学习在学生中越来越受欢迎。然而，它既有优点也有缺点。\n\n首先，网络学习非常方便灵活。学生可以在家上课，不用去学校，这节省了大量路途时间。此外，互联网上有丰富的学习资源。我们可以选择任何感兴趣的课程，按照自己的节奏学习。\n\n然而，网络学习也有一些缺点。一方面，它需要很强的自律性。没有老师的监督，一些学生可能玩游戏、看视频而不是学习。另一方面，长时间盯着屏幕对眼睛不好，而且我们缺少与老师和同学面对面的交流。\n\n总之，网络学习是一个有用的工具，但不是完美的。我们应该利用它的好处，同时避免它的弊端。","points":["经典议论文框架：引入→优点→缺点→结论","递进连接词：To begin with / Besides / Nevertheless / For one thing... For another","对比句式：without going to school which saves...、lack face-to-face communication","结尾总结并给出态度：take advantage of its benefits while avoiding its drawbacks"]},{"id":9,"year":"2021","type":"书信","title":"建议信：给朋友学习英语的建议","prompt":"你的朋友李明英语成绩不好，很苦恼。请你给他写一封英文信，提出学习英语的建议。要点：1.鼓励他；2.具体建议（多听多说、扩大词汇量、坚持写作等）；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你的朋友李明英语成绩不好，很苦恼。请你给他写一封英文信，提出学习英语的建议。要点：1.鼓励他；2.具体建议（多听多说、扩大词汇量、坚持写作等）；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Li Ming,\n\nI'm sorry to hear that you are worried about your English study. Don't feel discouraged. With proper methods and persistent efforts, you are sure to improve it.\n\nHere are some suggestions for you. First, listen to English songs and watch English movies as much as possible, which can help improve your listening and pronunciation. Second, keep a vocabulary notebook and review it regularly, because a large vocabulary is the basis of learning English well. Third, don't be afraid of making mistakes. Try to speak English bravely in class and write English diaries every day.\n\nRome was not built in a day. If you keep practicing, you will make great progress. I'm looking forward to your good news.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的李明：\n\n听说你在为英语学习而苦恼，我很难过。不要灰心。只要方法得当并坚持不懈，你一定能提高英语。\n\n这里有一些建议供你参考。首先，尽可能多地听英文歌曲、看英文电影，这有助于提高听力和发音。其次，准备一个词汇笔记本并定期复习，因为丰富的词汇量是学好英语的基础。第三，不要害怕犯错。在课堂上勇敢地说英语，每天写英语日记。\n\n罗马不是一天建成的。如果坚持练习，你一定会取得很大进步。期待你的好消息。\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["建议信结构：安慰鼓励→分条建议→祝愿展望","建议用First / Second / Third分层，每层有理由支撑（because...）","谚语点缀：Rome was not built in a day","鼓励性语言：you are sure to / don't be afraid of"]},{"id":10,"year":"2021","type":"应用文","title":"写一篇介绍校园的英文海报","prompt":"学校将举办校园开放日，请你写一份英文海报，向参观者介绍学校。要点：1.学校概况；2.校园设施；3.欢迎参观。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"学校将举办校园开放日，请你写一份英文海报，向参观者介绍学校。要点：1.学校概况；2.校园设施；3.欢迎参观。词数100左右。","essay":"Welcome to Our School!\n\nOur school was founded in 1958 and has a history of more than sixty years. It is located in the center of the city, with beautiful scenery and a quiet environment.\n\nThere are three teaching buildings, a modern library with over 500,000 books, and a large sports ground. In addition, we have well-equipped laboratories and computer rooms, where students can do experiments and practice programming. The teachers here are experienced and friendly, and the students are diligent and creative.\n\nOn the coming Open Day, we will organize a campus tour, exhibitions of students' works and some interesting activities. Everyone is warmly welcome to visit our school and enjoy the beauty of our campus!\n\nYours faithfully,\nThe Student Union","essay_cn":"欢迎来到我们学校！\n\n我校创建于1958年，已有六十多年的历史。学校位于市中心，风景优美，环境安静。\n\n学校有三栋教学楼、一座藏书50多万册的现代化图书馆，以及一个大型运动场。此外，我们还有设备齐全的实验室和机房，学生可以在这里做实验和练习编程。这里的老师经验丰富、和蔼可亲，学生们勤奋好学、富有创造力。\n\n在即将到来的开放日，我们将组织校园参观、学生作品展览和一些有趣的活动。热烈欢迎大家来参观我们学校，欣赏校园之美！\n\n此致\n敬礼\n学生会","points":["海报式应用文：标题醒目、内容分段介绍、结尾热情邀请","介绍学校用并列结构：There are... / In addition... / The teachers here are...","加入细节数字增强真实感（1958、500,000）","结尾呼应主题：Welcome to visit our school"]},{"id":11,"year":"2022","type":"议论文","title":"论保护环境的重要性","prompt":"环境问题日益严重。请以Protecting the Environment为题写一篇英语短文，说明环境保护的重要性并提出建议。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"环境问题日益严重。请以《保护环境》为题写一篇英语短文，说明环境保护的重要性并提出建议。词数120左右。","essay":"Protecting the Environment\n\nIn recent years, environmental problems have become more and more serious. Air pollution, water pollution and global warming are threatening our health and life. Therefore, it is high time that we took measures to protect the environment.\n\nFirst of all, the government should make stricter laws to limit the pollution caused by factories and vehicles. Secondly, we should develop and use clean energy, such as solar and wind energy, to reduce the emission of carbon dioxide. Thirdly, as students, we can do many small things in our daily life. For example, we can save water and electricity, sort the garbage, and ride bikes instead of taking cars.\n\nIn a word, protecting the environment is protecting ourselves. Everyone should play a part in making our earth a better place to live in.","essay_cn":"保护环境\n\n近年来，环境问题变得越来越严重。空气污染、水污染和全球变暖正威胁着我们的健康和生活。因此，现在是我们采取措施保护环境的时候了。\n\n首先，政府应该制定更严格的法律来限制工厂和车辆造成的污染。其次，我们应该开发和利用清洁能源，如太阳能和风能，以减少二氧化碳的排放。第三，作为学生，我们在日常生活中可以做一些小事。例如，我们可以节约用水用电、垃圾分类、骑车而不是开车。\n\n总之，保护环境就是保护我们自己。每个人都应该为建设更美好的地球家园出一份力。","points":["议论文三要素：提出问题→分层建议→总结呼吁","建议分层：First of all / Secondly / Thirdly 条理清晰","虚拟语气：it is high time that we took measures（提升档次）","结尾金句：Protecting the environment is protecting ourselves"]},{"id":12,"year":"2022","type":"书信","title":"申请信：申请加入大学英语俱乐部","prompt":"你校英语俱乐部正在招收新成员，请写一封英文申请信。要点：1.自我介绍；2.申请理由（热爱英语、想提高口语等）；3.期望被录取。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你校英语俱乐部正在招收新成员，请写一封英文申请信。要点：1.自我介绍；2.申请理由（热爱英语、想提高口语等）；3.期望被录取。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear President of the English Club,\n\nI am Li Hua, a freshman majoring in Computer Science. I am writing to apply for the membership of your English Club.\n\nI have been fond of English since I was a child and I am always eager to improve my spoken English. However, I seldom have the chance to practice speaking English in daily life. I believe that joining the English Club can provide me with a good platform to communicate with others in English. The English Corner and speech contests held by the club are especially attractive to me. Besides, I am an outgoing and cooperative person, so I can get along well with other members.\n\nI would be grateful if you could accept my application. I promise to take an active part in all the activities of the club.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的英语俱乐部主席：\n\n我是计算机科学专业大一新生李华。我写信申请加入贵英语俱乐部。\n\n我从小喜欢英语，一直渴望提高英语口语。然而，我在日常生活中很少有机会练习说英语。我相信加入英语俱乐部能为我提供一个用英语与他人交流的好平台。俱乐部举办的英语角和演讲比赛尤其吸引我。此外，我性格外向、善于合作，能与成员们相处融洽。\n\n如果您能接受我的申请，我将不胜感激。我保证积极参加俱乐部的所有活动。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["申请信要素：自我介绍→申请理由→承诺表态","用具体活动（English Corner、speech contests）体现诚意","性格描述+合作能力增强说服力","礼貌结尾：I would be grateful if you could... + 承诺积极参加"]},{"id":13,"year":"2022","type":"议论文","title":"论健康生活方式的重要性","prompt":"现代人越来越关注健康。请以Healthy Lifestyle为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.不健康的生活方式及其危害；2.如何养成健康的生活方式；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"现代人越来越关注健康。请以《健康的生活方式》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.不健康的生活方式及其危害；2.如何养成健康的生活方式；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"Healthy Lifestyle\n\nWith the fast pace of modern life, many people have developed unhealthy lifestyles. Staying up late, eating junk food and sitting in front of computers for hours have become common among young people. These habits do great harm to our health and may lead to serious diseases.\n\nTo live a healthy life, we should first keep a balanced diet. Eat more vegetables and fruit, and try to avoid fast food and sugary drinks. Secondly, regular exercise is of vital importance. We can run, swim or play ball games for at least thirty minutes every day. Thirdly, we should go to bed early and get up early, ensuring enough sleep of about eight hours.\n\nIn a word, health is the greatest wealth. Only when we are healthy can we study well, work well and enjoy a happy life. Let's start from today and say no to bad habits.","essay_cn":"健康的生活方式\n\n随着现代生活节奏的加快，许多人养成了不健康的生活方式。熬夜、吃垃圾食品、长时间坐在电脑前在年轻人中已经很普遍。这些习惯对我们的健康危害很大，可能导致严重的疾病。\n\n要过上健康的生活，我们首先应该保持均衡的饮食。多吃蔬菜水果，尽量避免快餐和含糖饮料。其次，规律运动至关重要。我们可以每天跑步、游泳或打球至少30分钟。第三，我们应该早睡早起，保证大约八小时的充足睡眠。\n\n总之，健康是最大的财富。只有身体健康，我们才能好好学习、好好工作、享受幸福生活。让我们从今天开始，对坏习惯说不。","points":["问题→对策→呼吁的结构","危害描述用may lead to / do great harm to 客观有力","建议分层：First / Secondly / Thirdly 搭配具体做法","金句收尾：Health is the greatest wealth + Only when...倒装"]},{"id":14,"year":"2022","type":"书信","title":"道歉信：为迟到道歉","prompt":"你约好周末和朋友去图书馆，但因有事迟到了半小时。请给朋友写一封英文道歉信。要点：1.表达歉意；2.解释原因；3.提出弥补办法。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你约好周末和朋友去图书馆，但因有事迟到了半小时。请给朋友写一封英文道歉信。要点：1.表达歉意；2.解释原因；3.提出弥补办法。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Xiao Wang,\n\nI am writing to apologize for being late for our appointment last weekend. I feel really sorry for having kept you waiting for half an hour in the library.\n\nThe reason was that my mother suddenly fell ill and I had to send her to the hospital. By the time she was settled down, it was already thirty minutes past our meeting time. I tried to call you, but your phone was out of service.\n\nTo make up for it, I would like to invite you to dinner this Friday. I promise it will not happen again. I hope you can forgive me.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的小王：\n\n我写信为上周末约会迟到向你道歉。让你在图书馆等了半个小时，我真的很抱歉。\n\n原因是我的妈妈突然生病了，我不得不送她去医院。等我安顿好她时，已经过了我们约定的时间30分钟。我试着给你打电话，但你的电话无法接通。\n\n为了弥补，我想这周五请你吃饭。我保证这种事不会再发生。希望你能原谅我。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["道歉信结构：致歉→解释原因→弥补方案","用具体原因增强可信度（母亲生病送医）","弥补措施真诚具体（请吃饭）","表态承诺：I promise it will not happen again"]},{"id":15,"year":"2022","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英语演讲比赛的通知","prompt":"学校将举办英语演讲比赛，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.比赛主题和时间地点；2.参赛要求；3.报名方式和奖励。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"学校将举办英语演讲比赛，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.比赛主题和时间地点；2.参赛要求；3.报名方式和奖励。词数100左右。","essay":"NOTICE\n\nIn order to enrich students' campus life and improve their oral English, the Student Union will hold an English Speech Contest next month.\n\nThe contest, whose theme is \"My Dream\", will be held in the school lecture hall at 2:00 p.m. on June 15th. Each contestant is required to give a speech of about three minutes. The speech should be written by the contestants themselves and delivered without reading the manuscript.\n\nStudents who want to take part in the contest should sign up at the Student Union office or send an email to studentunion@school.edu.cn before June 5th. The first three winners will be awarded certificates and prizes.\n\nEveryone is welcome to watch the contest and cheer for the contestants!\n\nThe Student Union","essay_cn":"通知\n\n为丰富同学们的校园生活、提高英语口语水平，学生会将于下月举办英语演讲比赛。\n\n本次比赛主题为「我的梦想」，将于6月15日下午2点在学校报告厅举行。每位参赛者需进行约三分钟的演讲。演讲稿须由参赛者自己撰写，并脱稿演讲。\n\n想参加比赛的同学请在6月5日前到学生会办公室报名，或发送邮件至 studentunion@school.edu.cn。前三名将获得证书和奖品。\n\n欢迎大家前来观赛，为选手加油！\n\n学生会","points":["通知要素齐全：目的、主题、时间地点、要求、报名、奖励","定语从句：whose theme is... 提升句式","脱稿要求体现比赛规范性","结尾欢迎观赛，语气热情"]},{"id":16,"year":"2022","type":"议论文","title":"论坚持的重要性","prompt":"成功离不开坚持。请以The Importance of Persistence为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.坚持的意义；2.举例说明；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"成功离不开坚持。请以《坚持的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.坚持的意义；2.举例说明；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Persistence\n\nAs the saying goes, \"Where there is a will, there is a way.\" Persistence is one of the most important qualities for success. Without it, no one can achieve great goals.\n\nTake learning English as an example. Many students fail not because they are not intelligent, but because they give up halfway. Vocabulary, grammar and listening all require long-term practice. Only those who keep studying every day can finally master the language. The same is true of other fields. Scientists like Edison succeeded after thousands of failed experiments, which shows that persistence can turn failure into success.\n\nIn my opinion, persistence means never giving up when facing difficulties. We should set a clear goal and stick to it. Remember, success belongs to those who are always ready to try again.","essay_cn":"坚持的重要性\n\n俗话说：「有志者事竟成。」坚持是成功最重要的品质之一。没有坚持，没有人能实现伟大的目标。\n\n以学英语为例。许多学生失败不是因为不聪明，而是因为半途而废。词汇、语法和听力都需要长期练习。只有那些每天坚持学习的人才能最终掌握这门语言。其他领域也是如此。像爱迪生这样的科学家是在成千上万次失败的实验后成功的，这表明坚持能把失败变成成功。\n\n在我看来，坚持意味着面对困难时永不放弃。我们应该设定明确的目标并坚持下去。记住，成功属于那些时刻准备再试一次的人。","points":["谚语开头吸引眼球：Where there is a will, there is a way","举例论证：学英语+爱迪生，说服力强","反面论证：give up halfway 与正面形成对比","结尾名言金句收束：Success belongs to those who..."]},{"id":17,"year":"2022","type":"书信","title":"祝贺信：祝贺朋友考试成功","prompt":"你的朋友小明在专升本考试中取得了优异成绩，请你写一封英文祝贺信。要点：1.表达祝贺；2.肯定他的努力；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你的朋友小明在专升本考试中取得了优异成绩，请你写一封英文祝贺信。要点：1.表达祝贺；2.肯定他的努力；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Xiao Ming,\n\nI am writing to offer my sincere congratulations on your excellent performance in the college entrance examination for undergraduates. What great news it is!\n\nYour success didn't come easily. I still remember how hard you worked: getting up early to memorize words, staying up late to solve problems and spending every weekend in the library. Your diligence and persistence have finally paid off. You deserve this success and I am really proud of you.\n\nNow you are going to enter a new stage of study. I believe you will achieve even greater success in the future. Let's keep in touch and encourage each other in our study.\n\nOnce again, congratulations and best wishes!\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的小明：\n\n我写信对你专升本考试取得优异成绩表示衷心的祝贺。这真是个天大的好消息！\n\n你的成功来之不易。我仍记得你多么努力：早起背单词、熬夜解题、每个周末泡在图书馆。你的勤奋和坚持终于得到了回报。你配得上这份成功，我为你感到骄傲。\n\n现在你即将进入新的学习阶段。我相信你未来会取得更大的成就。让我们保持联系，在学习中互相鼓励。\n\n再次祝贺你，并致以最美好的祝愿！\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["祝贺信结构：祝贺→肯定努力→展望祝愿","感叹句开头增强情绪：What great news it is!","回忆细节增强真诚感（早起背词、周末泡图书馆）","常用表达：pay off / be proud of / deserve"]},{"id":18,"year":"2022","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文寻物启事","prompt":"你在图书馆丢失了一个黑色背包，里面有电脑和课本。请你写一份英文寻物启事。要点：1.丢失物品描述；2.丢失时间和地点；3.联系方式与感谢。词数80左右。","prompt_cn":"你在图书馆丢失了一个黑色背包，里面有电脑和课本。请你写一份英文寻物启事。要点：1.丢失物品描述；2.丢失时间和地点；3.联系方式与感谢。词数80左右。","essay":"LOST\n\nOn the afternoon of May 10th, I lost a black backpack in the library. It was left on a chair on the third floor of the library building around 3 p.m.\n\nThe backpack contains a laptop computer, two textbooks and a notebook. The laptop is very important to me because it stores all my study materials and project files.\n\nIf anyone finds it, please contact me at 138-XXXX-XXXX or send an email to lihua@school.edu.cn. I would be very grateful for your help. Thanks a lot!\n\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"寻物启事\n\n5月10日下午，我在图书馆丢失了一个黑色背包。大约下午3点，它被放在图书馆三楼的一把椅子上。\n\n背包里有一台笔记本电脑、两本课本和一个笔记本。这台电脑对我非常重要，因为它存有我的所有学习资料和项目文件。\n\n如有拾到者，请拨打138-XXXX-XXXX与我联系，或发送邮件至 lihua@school.edu.cn。我将不胜感激。非常感谢！\n\n李华","points":["寻物启事格式：标题LOST、物品描述、丢失信息、联系方式","物品描述具体（颜色、位置、内含物）","强调物品重要性增加找回概率","结尾礼貌感谢：I would be very grateful for your help"]},{"id":19,"year":"2023","type":"书信","title":"给笔友写一封信介绍大学生活","prompt":"你的英国笔友Jack想了解你的大学生活。请给他写一封英文信。要点：1.专业和学习情况；2.课余活动；3.对大学生活的感受。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你的英国笔友杰克想了解你的大学生活。请给他写一封英文信。要点：1.专业和学习情况；2.课余活动；3.对大学生活的感受。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Jack,\n\nI'm glad to receive your letter. You asked about my college life, so let me tell you something about it.\n\nI am majoring in Computer Science at a college in Yunnan. We have many interesting courses, such as programming, database and network technology. The teachers are knowledgeable and always ready to help us. In my spare time, I often go to the library, where I read books about the latest technology and practice coding.\n\nBesides study, I also take part in colorful activities. I am a member of the basketball team and we play matches every weekend. Sometimes I join the English Corner to practice my spoken English, which is both useful and enjoyable.\n\nI really enjoy my college life because it is full of challenges and fun. How about your life in the UK? I'm looking forward to your reply.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的杰克：\n\n很高兴收到你的来信。你问起我的大学生活，让我跟你讲讲吧。\n\n我在云南一所大学学习计算机科学专业。我们有很多有趣的课程，比如编程、数据库和网络技术。老师们知识渊博，总是乐于帮助我们。课余时间我经常去图书馆，在那里阅读最新技术方面的书籍并练习编程。\n\n除了学习，我还参加丰富多彩的活动。我是篮球队的成员，每个周末都打比赛。有时我参加英语角练习口语，既实用又有趣。\n\n我真的很喜欢我的大学生活，因为它充满挑战和乐趣。你在英国的生活怎么样？期待你的回信。\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["回信开头呼应来信：You asked about...","专业介绍贴近计算机考生实际（编程、数据库、网络）","非限制性定语从句：where I read... / which is both useful and enjoyable","结尾反问对方，保持书信互动感"]},{"id":20,"year":"2023","type":"议论文","title":"论大学生沉迷网络游戏的问题","prompt":"部分大学生沉迷网络游戏，影响了学习和健康。请以Online Games and College Students为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.沉迷游戏的危害；2.原因分析；3.建议。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"部分大学生沉迷网络游戏，影响了学习和健康。请以《网络游戏与大学生》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.沉迷游戏的危害；2.原因分析；3.建议。词数120左右。","essay":"Online Games and College Students\n\nIn recent years, online games have become increasingly popular among college students. While games can bring us relaxation and fun, too much addiction to them does great harm.\n\nTo begin with, playing games for hours every day wastes plenty of precious time that should be spent on study. Some students skip classes and fail their exams because of games. Moreover, sitting in front of the screen for a long time is harmful to our eyes and body, and staying up late to play games destroys our health.\n\nWhy do so many students get addicted? One reason is that some students lack self-control and clear goals in college life. Another is that they use games to escape from the pressure of study and the loneliness of being away from home.\n\nIn my opinion, students should arrange their time reasonably and develop healthy hobbies. The university can also organize more colorful activities to attract students away from the virtual world. Only in this way can we make good use of games instead of being controlled by them.","essay_cn":"网络游戏与大学生\n\n近年来，网络游戏在大学生中越来越受欢迎。虽然游戏能带给我们放松和乐趣，但过度沉迷危害很大。\n\n首先，每天花数小时玩游戏浪费了大量本该用于学习的时间。一些学生因为游戏逃课、考试不及格。此外，长时间坐在屏幕前对眼睛和身体有害，熬夜玩游戏毁坏健康。\n\n为什么这么多学生沉迷其中？一个原因是有些学生在大学生活中缺乏自制力和明确的目标。另一个原因是他们用游戏逃避学习压力和离家的孤独感。\n\n在我看来，学生应该合理安排时间，培养健康的爱好。学校也可以组织更多丰富多彩的活动，把学生从虚拟世界吸引回来。只有这样，我们才能善用游戏，而不是被游戏控制。","points":["问题型议论文：危害→原因→建议","危害论证有层次：浪费时间、危害身体","原因分析用One reason... Another reason... 结构","结尾倒装句+辩证观点：make good use of games instead of being controlled by them"]},{"id":21,"year":"2023","type":"应用文","title":"写一封英文电子邮件预约图书馆讲座","prompt":"学校图书馆将举办数据库使用讲座，你想预约参加。请写一封英文电子邮件给图书馆老师。要点：1.自我介绍并说明来意；2.询问讲座时间和报名方式；3.表达期待。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"学校图书馆将举办数据库使用讲座，你想预约参加。请写一封英文电子邮件给图书馆老师。要点：1.自我介绍并说明来意；2.询问讲座时间和报名方式；3.表达期待。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Librarian,\n\nI am Li Hua, a sophomore majoring in Computer Science. I am writing to ask for some information about the lecture on database usage that will be held in the library.\n\nI am very interested in this lecture because I often use databases for my course projects, and I want to learn more skills to search for academic resources efficiently. However, I haven't seen the detailed arrangement of the lecture. Could you please tell me when and where it will be held? I also want to know whether I need to sign up in advance and how I can register.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could give me the details. I am looking forward to attending the lecture and learning a lot from it.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的图书馆老师：\n\n我是计算机科学专业大二学生李华。我写信是想咨询图书馆将举办的数据库使用讲座的相关信息。\n\n我对这次讲座非常感兴趣，因为我经常在课程项目中使用数据库，想学习更多高效检索学术资源的技巧。但是，我还没有看到讲座的详细安排。您能告诉我讲座的时间和地点吗？我还想知道是否需要提前报名以及如何报名。\n\n如果您能告诉我详细信息，我将不胜感激。我期待参加这次讲座并从中学习很多。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["电子邮件格式：主题明确、称呼、正文、结尾","询问信息用礼貌句式：Could you please tell me...","说明兴趣原因增强真实性（课程项目用数据库）","结尾表达期待与感谢"]},{"id":22,"year":"2023","type":"议论文","title":"论读书的好处","prompt":"阅读对个人成长非常重要。请以The Benefits of Reading为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.读书的好处；2.如何养成阅读习惯；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"阅读对个人成长非常重要。请以《读书的好处》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.读书的好处；2.如何养成阅读习惯；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"The Benefits of Reading\n\nReading is one of the most valuable habits a person can develop. It brings us knowledge, wisdom and endless joy.\n\nFirst of all, reading broadens our horizons. Through books, we can travel around the world and learn about different cultures without leaving home. Besides, reading improves our thinking ability. When we read, we are forced to think, question and reflect, which makes our mind sharper. Moreover, reading is a good way to relax. After a tiring day, losing ourselves in a good book can reduce stress and bring us peace.\n\nTo develop the habit of reading, we can set aside some time every day, even just twenty minutes before going to bed. We can also join a reading club or share our feelings about books with friends, which will make reading more interesting.\n\nIn my opinion, reading is like talking with wise men. The more we read, the more we learn and the better we grow. Let's open a book and start our journey of reading today.","essay_cn":"读书的好处\n\n阅读是一个人能养成的最有价值的习惯之一。它带给我们知识、智慧和无穷的乐趣。\n\n首先，读书开阔我们的视野。通过书籍，我们足不出户就能环游世界，了解不同的文化。此外，读书提高我们的思考能力。阅读时，我们被迫思考、质疑和反思，这让我们的头脑更加敏锐。而且，读书是放松的好方式。劳累一天后，沉浸在好书中可以减轻压力，带给我们平静。\n\n要养成阅读习惯，我们可以每天留出一些时间，哪怕只是睡前20分钟。我们也可以加入读书俱乐部，或与朋友分享读书感受，这会让阅读更有趣。\n\n在我看来，读书就像与智者交谈。读得越多，学得越多，成长得越好。让我们打开一本书，开启今天的阅读之旅吧。","points":["主题句+分层论证：开阔视野/提升思维/放松减压","动名词短语做主语：Reading is / losing ourselves in...","建议具体可行（睡前20分钟）","结尾金句：Reading is like talking with wise men + the more... the more..."]},{"id":23,"year":"2023","type":"书信","title":"投诉信：投诉食堂饭菜问题","prompt":"你校食堂近期饭菜质量下降。请你以学生代表身份给校长写一封英文投诉信。要点：1.说明问题；2.影响；3.提出建议。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你校食堂近期饭菜质量下降。请你以学生代表身份给校长写一封英文投诉信。要点：1.说明问题；2.影响；3.提出建议。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear President,\n\nI am writing on behalf of the students to complain about the quality of the food in our school canteen.\n\nRecently, many students have found that the food is not as fresh and delicious as before. The dishes are sometimes cold and the price is getting higher and higher. What is worse, some students got stomachaches after eating in the canteen, which worries us a lot.\n\nA good canteen is important for our health and study. I suggest that the school should strengthen the supervision of the canteen and check the food quality regularly. Besides, the menu should be more varied and the prices should be reasonable.\n\nI hope our suggestions can be taken into consideration. Thank you for your attention.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的校长：\n\n我代表全体学生写信，投诉学校食堂的饭菜质量问题。\n\n最近，许多同学发现饭菜不像以前那样新鲜可口了。菜品有时是凉的，价格也越来越高。更糟糕的是，一些同学在食堂用餐后肚子疼，这让我们非常担心。\n\n一个好的食堂对我们的健康和学习都很重要。我建议学校加强对食堂的监管，定期检查食品质量。此外，菜单应该更加多样化，价格应该合理。\n\n希望我们的建议能被考虑。感谢您的关注。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["投诉信结构：说明问题→影响→建议","问题描述具体（不新鲜、凉菜、涨价、生病）","建议条理清晰（监管、检查、多样化、价格）","礼貌收尾：I hope our suggestions can be taken into consideration"]},{"id":24,"year":"2023","type":"应用文","title":"写一封英文演讲稿：我的梦想","prompt":"学校举办以My Dream为主题的演讲比赛，请你写一篇英文演讲稿。要点：1.你的梦想是什么；2.为什么有这个梦想；3.如何实现它。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"学校举办以「我的梦想」为主题的演讲比赛，请你写一篇英文演讲稿。要点：1.你的梦想是什么；2.为什么有这个梦想；3.如何实现它。词数120左右。","essay":"My Dream\n\nGood morning, everyone! Today I am honored to give a speech about my dream.\n\nMy dream is to become a software engineer. Ever since I wrote my first program in high school, I have been deeply attracted by the magic of technology. I hope that one day I can develop software to make people's lives more convenient, for example, apps that help students study more efficiently.\n\nHowever, I know that dreams cannot come true without hard work. To realize my dream, I will study my major courses diligently, especially programming and data structures. I will also take part in coding competitions and do more practical projects to improve my ability. Besides, learning English well is necessary because many excellent technical resources are written in English.\n\nAs the saying goes, \"The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.\" I will start from now and never give up until my dream comes true.\n\nThank you for listening!","essay_cn":"我的梦想\n\n大家早上好！今天我很荣幸就我的梦想发表演讲。\n\n我的梦想是成为一名软件工程师。自从高中第一次编写程序以来，我就被科技的神奇深深吸引。我希望有一天能开发出让人们生活更便利的软件，比如帮助学生更高效学习的应用。\n\n然而，我知道梦想不努力是无法实现的。为了实现梦想，我会勤奋学习专业课程，尤其是编程和数据结构。我还会参加编程竞赛，做更多实践项目来提高能力。此外，学好英语是必要的，因为许多优秀的技术资料都是英文写的。\n\n俗话说：「千里之行，始于足下。」我会从现在开始，永不放弃，直到梦想成真。\n\n谢谢聆听！","points":["演讲稿格式：问候开场→主题→号召结尾","梦想具体可感（软件工程师+具体应用场景）","实现路径清晰（课程、竞赛、实践、英语）","谚语收尾：The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step"]},{"id":25,"year":"2023","type":"书信","title":"求助信：请外教修改演讲稿","prompt":"你准备参加英语演讲比赛，想请外教Mr. Brown帮忙修改演讲稿。请写一封英文求助信。要点：1.自我介绍和请求；2.说明缘由；3.表达感谢。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你准备参加英语演讲比赛，想请外教布朗先生帮忙修改演讲稿。请写一封英文求助信。要点：1.自我介绍和请求；2.说明缘由；3.表达感谢。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Mr. Brown,\n\nI am Li Hua, a student from Class 2. I am writing to ask you for a favor.\n\nNext month, I will take part in the English Speech Contest held by our school, and my speech is about \"The Power of Persistence\". I have already finished the first draft, but I am not confident about its language and structure. Since you are an expert in English and have rich experience in public speaking, I wonder if you could spare some time to help me polish my speech. Your suggestions on grammar, wording and pronunciation would be of great value to me.\n\nI know you are very busy, but I would be extremely grateful if you could help me. I can send the draft to you by email, and we can discuss it whenever it is convenient for you.\n\nThank you very much for your time and kindness.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的布朗先生：\n\n我是2班的学生李华。我写信是想请您帮个忙。\n\n下个月，我将参加学校举办的英语演讲比赛，我的演讲题目是「坚持的力量」。我已经完成了初稿，但对它的语言和结构不太自信。由于您是英语专家，又有丰富的演讲经验，我想知道您能否抽出时间帮我润色演讲稿。您对语法、措辞和发音的建议对我将非常有价值。\n\n我知道您很忙，但如果您能帮助我，我将万分感激。我可以把稿子通过邮件发给您，在您方便的时候随时讨论。\n\n非常感谢您的时间和善意。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["求助信要点：礼貌请求→说明缘由→感谢","夸赞对方专长增强请求合理性（expert in English）","给出便利条件（邮件发送、时间灵活）","礼貌措辞：I wonder if / I would be extremely grateful"]},{"id":26,"year":"2023","type":"议论文","title":"论时间管理的重要性","prompt":"大学生常常感到时间不够用。请以Time Management为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.时间管理的重要性；2.如何有效管理时间；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"大学生常常感到时间不够用。请以《时间管理》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.时间管理的重要性；2.如何有效管理时间；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"Time Management\n\n\"Time is money,\" as the saying goes. However, many college students often complain that they don't have enough time to finish their tasks. The key to solving this problem is good time management.\n\nGood time management can help us study more efficiently and live a more balanced life. With proper planning, we can finish our homework on time, leave enough time for rest and still have time for hobbies. On the contrary, without it, we may rush from one task to another and end up feeling tired and anxious.\n\nHow can we manage our time well? First, we should make a to-do list and arrange tasks according to their importance and urgency. Second, we can use fragmented time, such as waiting time on the bus, to memorize words or review notes. Third, we should avoid procrastination and finish today's work today.\n\nIn conclusion, time is the most precious resource we have. If we manage it wisely, we can achieve more and enjoy our college life to the fullest.","essay_cn":"时间管理\n\n俗话说：「时间就是金钱。」然而，许多大学生常常抱怨没有足够的时间完成任务。解决这个问题的关键是良好的时间管理。\n\n好的时间管理能帮助我们更高效地学习，过上更平衡的生活。有了合理的规划，我们能按时完成作业，留出充足的休息时间，还有时间发展爱好。相反，没有规划，我们可能从一个任务赶到另一个任务，最终感到疲惫和焦虑。\n\n我们怎样才能管理好时间？首先，我们应该列任务清单，按照重要性和紧急程度安排任务。其次，我们可以利用碎片时间，比如等车时间，来背单词或复习笔记。第三，我们应该避免拖延，今日事今日毕。\n\n总之，时间是我们拥有的最宝贵的资源。如果我们明智地管理它，就能取得更多成就，充分享受大学生活。","points":["谚语引入+问题引出观点","对比论证：with planning / without it 正反对比","建议具体：清单、碎片时间、拒绝拖延","结尾升华：time is the most precious resource"]},{"id":27,"year":"2024","type":"书信","title":"给父母写一封信汇报学习情况","prompt":"你刚进入大学，请给父母写一封英文信，汇报你的学习和生活情况。要点：1.学校环境和专业；2.学习和生活情况；3.表达思念和决心。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你刚进入大学，请给父母写一封英文信，汇报你的学习和生活情况。要点：1.学校环境和专业；2.学习和生活情况；3.表达思念和决心。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Mom and Dad,\n\nHow time flies! It has been two months since I entered college. I miss you very much and I'm writing to tell you about my new life.\n\nOur campus is very beautiful with green trees and clean paths. I am majoring in Computer Science, which is exactly what I like. The courses are a little difficult, but the teachers are patient and my classmates are friendly. I have made several good friends and we often study together in the library.\n\nDon't worry about me. I can take good care of myself. I get up early every day, eat three meals regularly and do exercise in the evening. I know you work hard for me, so I will study diligently and make you proud.\n\nPlease take care of yourselves. I love you and look forward to seeing you during the winter vacation.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的爸爸妈妈：\n\n时间过得真快！我进入大学已经两个月了。我非常想念你们，写信告诉你们我的新生活。\n\n我们的校园非常美丽，绿树成荫，道路干净。我学的计算机科学专业正是我喜欢的。课程有点难，但老师很耐心，同学很友好。我交了几个好朋友，我们经常一起在图书馆学习。\n\n不要担心我。我能照顾好自己。我每天早起，三餐规律，晚上锻炼。我知道你们为我辛苦工作，所以我会努力学习，让你们骄傲。\n\n请保重身体。我爱你们，期待寒假见面。\n\n你们的\n李华","points":["家书情感真挚：思念+汇报+报平安+表态","三段式：校园生活→学习交友→健康决心","宽慰父母：Don't worry about me / take good care of myself","结尾温情：I love you and look forward to seeing you"]},{"id":28,"year":"2024","type":"议论文","title":"论人工智能对生活的影响","prompt":"人工智能技术发展迅速。请以The Influence of AI on Our Life为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.AI带来的便利；2.AI带来的挑战；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"人工智能技术发展迅速。请以《人工智能对我们生活的影响》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.AI带来的便利；2.AI带来的挑战；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"The Influence of AI on Our Life\n\nIn recent years, artificial intelligence has developed rapidly and entered every corner of our life. It brings us great convenience as well as new challenges.\n\nOn the one hand, AI has made our life much easier. Smartphones can recognize our faces and voices, navigation apps can guide us to any place, and online translation tools help us understand foreign languages. In education, AI can offer personalized learning plans according to students' different levels, which improves learning efficiency greatly.\n\nOn the other hand, AI also brings some problems. Many traditional jobs may be replaced by machines, which makes some people worried about unemployment. Besides, the wide use of AI raises concerns about privacy and security, because our personal data may be collected and used without permission.\n\nIn my opinion, AI is a powerful tool created by humans. We should make full use of it to serve our society while making laws to ensure it is used properly. Only in this way can technology bring us a brighter future.","essay_cn":"人工智能对我们生活的影响\n\n近年来，人工智能发展迅速，进入了我们生活的每个角落。它既给我们带来了巨大便利，也带来了新的挑战。\n\n一方面，AI让我们的生活轻松了许多。智能手机能识别人脸和语音，导航应用能带我们去任何地方，在线翻译工具帮我们理解外语。在教育领域，AI可以根据学生不同水平提供个性化学习方案，大大提高了学习效率。\n\n另一方面，AI也带来一些问题。许多传统工作可能被机器取代，这让一些人担心失业。此外，AI的广泛使用引发了隐私和安全的担忧，因为我们的个人数据可能在未经许可的情况下被收集和使用。\n\n在我看来，AI是人类创造的强大工具。我们应该充分利用它为我们的社会服务，同时制定法律确保它被正确使用。只有这样，科技才能带给我们更光明的未来。","points":["热点话题：AI利弊分析，结构清晰","好处举例贴近生活（人脸识别、导航、翻译）","挑战论证：失业+隐私，双角度","结尾辩证：make full use of it while making laws + Only in this way倒装"]},{"id":29,"year":"2024","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文志愿者招募启事","prompt":"社区将举办老年人电脑培训活动，请你写一份英文志愿者招募启事。要点：1.活动介绍；2.志愿者要求；3.报名方式。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"社区将举办老年人电脑培训活动，请你写一份英文志愿者招募启事。要点：1.活动介绍；2.志愿者要求；3.报名方式。词数100左右。","essay":"Volunteers Wanted\n\nOur community will organize a computer training program for the elderly next month. The program aims to help old people learn to use computers and smartphones so that they can keep in touch with their families and enjoy modern life.\n\nThe training will be held every Saturday afternoon from 2 p.m. to 5 p.m. at the Community Service Center, lasting for four weeks. Therefore, we are now looking for volunteers who are patient, warm-hearted and good at computer skills. College students are especially welcome. Your main task is to teach the elderly how to use basic functions, such as sending messages, making video calls and browsing news.\n\nIf you are interested in this meaningful activity, please sign up at the community office or send an email to community@service.cn before the end of this month. Let's work together to bring warmth to the elderly!\n\nCommunity Service Center","essay_cn":"招募志愿者\n\n我们社区将于下月为老年人举办电脑培训活动。该活动旨在帮助老人学会使用电脑和智能手机，让他们能与家人保持联系，享受现代生活。\n\n培训将于每周六下午2点到5点在社区服务中心举行，为期四周。因此，我们现在正在招募有耐心、热心、精通电脑技能的志愿者。特别欢迎大学生参加。你的主要任务是教老人使用基本功能，如发消息、打视频电话和浏览新闻。\n\n如果你对这个有意义的活动感兴趣，请在本月底前到社区办公室报名，或发送邮件至 community@service.cn。让我们一起为老人送去温暖！\n\n社区服务中心","points":["招募启事要素：标题、活动介绍、要求、报名方式","目的状语开头：The program aims to help...","志愿者素质要求明确（patient, warm-hearted, good at computer skills）","结尾公益号召：bring warmth to the elderly"]},{"id":30,"year":"2024","type":"议论文","title":"论体育锻炼的重要性","prompt":"越来越多的大学生缺乏锻炼。请以The Importance of Physical Exercise为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.缺乏锻炼的现状和危害；2.锻炼的好处；3.建议。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"越来越多的大学生缺乏锻炼。请以《体育锻炼的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.缺乏锻炼的现状和危害；2.锻炼的好处；3.建议。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Physical Exercise\n\nNowadays, many college students spend most of their time on study and the Internet, and pay little attention to physical exercise. As a result, their health is getting worse and worse, and some of them are overweight or often feel tired.\n\nRegular physical exercise is of great benefit to us. First, it can strengthen our body and improve our immunity, so that we can resist diseases. Second, exercise is a good way to relax. After doing sports, we often feel refreshed and our pressure can be reduced. Third, team sports such as basketball and football can help us make friends and learn to cooperate with others.\n\nTherefore, I suggest that every student should take part in sports activities at least three times a week. The school should also hold more sports competitions and provide better sports facilities. Remember, a healthy body is the foundation of everything. Let's move and keep fit!","essay_cn":"体育锻炼的重要性\n\n如今，许多大学生把大部分时间花在学习和网络上，很少注意体育锻炼。结果，他们的健康状况越来越差，有些人超重或经常感到疲惫。\n\n规律锻炼对我们非常有益。首先，它能强身健体，提高免疫力，使我们抵抗疾病。其次，锻炼是放松的好方式。运动后，我们常常感到精神焕发，压力也能减轻。第三，篮球、足球等团队运动能帮我们交朋友，学会与人合作。\n\n因此，我建议每位学生每周至少参加三次体育活动。学校也应该举办更多体育比赛，提供更好的运动设施。记住，健康的身体是一切的基础。让我们动起来，保持健康！","points":["现状描述→好处论证→建议呼吁","好处三点：强身健体/放松减压/团队合作","建议量化具体（每周三次）","结尾金句：A healthy body is the foundation of everything"]},{"id":31,"year":"2024","type":"书信","title":"邀请信：邀请同学参加英语角","prompt":"你负责组织学校英语角活动，请给同学写一封英文邀请信。要点：1.活动时间和地点；2.活动内容；3.期待参加。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你负责组织学校英语角活动，请给同学写一封英文邀请信。要点：1.活动时间和地点；2.活动内容；3.期待参加。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear classmates,\n\nI am glad to tell you that the English Corner will be held on Friday evening this week, and all of you are warmly invited to join us.\n\nThe English Corner will take place in the Students' Activity Center from 7:00 to 9:00 p.m. on Friday. This time, the topic is \"The Most Impressive Experience in College\". We have invited two foreign teachers to join us, so you will have a good chance to practice your oral English with native speakers. Besides free talk, we have prepared some interesting games and short plays for you to enjoy.\n\nWhether you are good at English or not, you are welcome to come. What matters is not the correctness of your English, but your courage to speak. Don't be shy and just enjoy yourselves!\n\nI am looking forward to seeing you at the English Corner.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的同学们：\n\n很高兴告诉大家，英语角将于本周五晚上举行，热烈欢迎大家参加。\n\n英语角将于周五晚上7点到9点在学生活动中心举行。本次主题是「大学里最难忘的经历」。我们邀请了两名外教参加，你们将有机会与母语者练习口语。除了自由交谈，我们还准备了一些有趣的游戏和短剧供大家欣赏。\n\n无论你英语好坏，都欢迎参加。重要的不是英语是否正确，而是你敢于开口。不要害羞，尽情享受吧！\n\n期待在英语角见到大家。\n\n你们的\n李华","points":["邀请信面向同学，语气亲切","活动信息完整：时间地点主题外教","鼓励性语言：What matters is not... but...","结尾亲切：Don't be shy and just enjoy yourselves"]},{"id":32,"year":"2024","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文失物招领启事","prompt":"你在操场捡到一个钱包，请写一份英文失物招领启事。要点：1.捡到物品描述；2.认领方式；3.请失主核实。词数80左右。","prompt_cn":"你在操场捡到一个钱包，请写一份英文失物招领启事。要点：1.捡到物品描述；2.认领方式；3.请失主核实。词数80左右。","essay":"FOUND\n\nOn the afternoon of May 15th, I found a brown wallet on the playground. The wallet contains some money, a student card and a photo, but no name or phone number was found inside.\n\nIf you lost your wallet, please contact me to claim it. You can call me at 138-XXXX-XXXX or come to Room 302, Dormitory 5. To make sure the wallet is returned to its owner, you will be asked to describe the wallet and the things inside it, such as the color of the student card.\n\nPlease contact me as soon as possible. I am looking forward to returning it to its owner.\n\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"失物招领\n\n5月15日下午，我在操场上捡到一个棕色钱包。钱包里有现金、一张学生卡和一张照片，但里面没有找到姓名或电话号码。\n\n如果你丢了钱包，请联系我认领。你可以拨打138-XXXX-XXXX或到5号宿舍楼302室找我。为确保钱包归还给失主，认领时需要描述钱包及里面的物品，比如学生卡的颜色。\n\n请尽快联系我。期待物归原主。\n\n李华","points":["招领启事要素：捡到时间地点、物品描述、认领方式","安全措施：要求描述物品细节防冒领","留多种联系方式（电话+地址）","结尾表达归还意愿：looking forward to returning it"]},{"id":33,"year":"2024","type":"议论文","title":"论志愿服务对大学生成长的意义","prompt":"越来越多的大学生参加志愿服务。请以The Significance of Volunteer Service为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.志愿服务的好处；2.举例说明；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"越来越多的大学生参加志愿服务。请以《志愿服务的意义》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.志愿服务的好处；2.举例说明；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"The Significance of Volunteer Service\n\nNowadays, an increasing number of college students take an active part in volunteer service. It has become a meaningful part of their college life.\n\nTo begin with, volunteer service helps us develop a sense of responsibility and social awareness. By helping others, we realize that we are part of the society and we should contribute to it. For example, when I served as a volunteer in a nursing home last month, I helped the elderly clean their rooms and chatted with them. Their smiles made me understand the true value of giving. Furthermore, volunteer work can improve our practical abilities, such as communication skills, teamwork and problem-solving skills, which are useful for our future career.\n\nIn addition, volunteer service can enrich our life experience and bring us inner happiness. The feeling of being needed and appreciated is more valuable than any material reward.\n\nIn my opinion, volunteer service is a win-win activity. It not only benefits the society but also helps us grow into better persons. I will continue to take part in it and encourage more students to join me.","essay_cn":"志愿服务的意义\n\n如今，越来越多的大学生积极参加志愿服务。它已成为大学生活中有意义的一部分。\n\n首先，志愿服务帮助我们培养责任感和公民意识。通过帮助他人，我们意识到自己是社会的一部分，应该为社会做贡献。例如，上个月我在养老院做志愿者时，帮助老人打扫房间，和他们聊天。他们的笑容让我明白了付出的真正价值。此外，志愿工作能提高我们的实践能力，如沟通技巧、团队合作和解决问题能力，这些对未来职业很有用。\n\n而且，志愿服务能丰富我们的生活经历，带来内心的快乐。被需要和被感激的感觉比任何物质回报都更有价值。\n\n在我看来，志愿服务是一项双赢的活动。它不仅造福社会，也帮助我们成长为更好的人。我会继续参加，并鼓励更多同学加入。","points":["意义型议论文：好处→实例→感悟","亲身经历举例（养老院志愿者）真实感人","能力提升与精神收获双重论证","结尾升华：win-win activity + not only... but also..."]},{"id":34,"year":"2024","type":"书信","title":"感谢信：感谢同学生病时的帮助","prompt":"你生病住院期间，同学小红一直照顾你。请给她写一封英文感谢信。要点：1.表达感谢；2.回忆帮助细节；3.表达友谊。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你生病住院期间，同学小红一直照顾你。请给她写一封英文感谢信。要点：1.表达感谢；2.回忆帮助细节；3.表达友谊。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Xiao Hong,\n\nI am writing to express my heartfelt thanks to you for taking care of me when I was ill in hospital last week.\n\nDuring those difficult days, you came to see me almost every day after class. You brought me delicious food, helped me take notes of the lessons I missed, and encouraged me not to worry about my study. What touched me most was that you gave up your weekend rest to stay with me and tell me funny stories to cheer me up. Thanks to your care, I recovered quickly and am now back to school.\n\nA friend in need is a friend indeed. I am so lucky to have a friend like you. Our friendship means a lot to me and I will treasure it forever. If you need any help in the future, please don't hesitate to tell me.\n\nThank you again from the bottom of my heart!\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的小红：\n\n我写信向你表达衷心的感谢，感谢上周我生病住院期间你对我的照顾。\n\n在那段艰难的日子里，你几乎每天下课后都来看我。你给我带好吃的，帮我记落下的课堂笔记，还鼓励我不要担心学习。最让我感动的是，你放弃周末休息来陪我，讲有趣的故事逗我开心。多亏了你的照顾，我恢复得很快，现在已经回到学校了。\n\n患难见真情。有你这样的朋友，我太幸运了。我们的友谊对我意义重大，我会永远珍惜。将来如果你需要任何帮助，请一定告诉我。\n\n再次发自内心地感谢你！\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["感谢信情感真挚，细节具体（送饭、记笔记、陪伴）","强调句型：What touched me most was that...","谚语点睛：A friend in need is a friend indeed","结尾互惠承诺，友谊升华"]},{"id":35,"year":"2025","type":"议论文","title":"论大学生使用短视频的利与弊","prompt":"短视频在大学生中非常流行。请以Short Videos and College Students为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.短视频流行的原因；2.利与弊；3.你的建议。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"短视频在大学生中非常流行。请以《短视频与大学生》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.短视频流行的原因；2.利与弊；3.你的建议。词数120左右。","essay":"Short Videos and College Students\n\nIn recent years, short videos have become an inseparable part of college students' daily life. Platforms like Douyin and Kuaishou are popular among young people because the videos are short, interesting and easy to watch anytime.\n\nShort videos do have some advantages. They can help us relax after a busy day, and we can learn useful knowledge from some educational videos, such as cooking, English learning and computer skills. However, the disadvantages should not be ignored. Many students are addicted to watching short videos and spend several hours on them every day, which wastes precious study time. Besides, the content of some videos is of low quality and even harmful to young people's values.\n\nIn my opinion, short videos are like a double-edged sword. We should control the time we spend on them and choose the content carefully. The key is to make them a tool for learning and relaxation, not a waste of our youth.","essay_cn":"短视频与大学生\n\n近年来，短视频已成为大学生日常生活中不可分割的一部分。抖音、快手等平台在年轻人中很受欢迎，因为视频短小、有趣、随时可看。\n\n短视频确实有一些好处。它们能帮助我们在忙碌一天后放松，我们也可以从一些教育类视频中学习有用的知识，如烹饪、英语学习和电脑技能。然而，缺点也不容忽视。许多学生沉迷于刷短视频，每天花费数小时，浪费了宝贵的学习时间。此外，一些视频内容质量低劣，甚至对年轻人的价值观有害。\n\n在我看来，短视频就像一把双刃剑。我们应该控制观看时间，仔细选择内容。关键是要让它成为学习和放松的工具，而不是浪费青春。","points":["流行原因分析（短、有趣、随时看）","利弊对比，利少弊多侧重警示","结合学习场景举例（英语学习、电脑技能）","结尾态度鲜明：make them a tool for learning, not a waste of youth"]},{"id":36,"year":"2025","type":"书信","title":"推荐信：向老师推荐同学做助手","prompt":"你校实验室需要一名学生助理，请你给李老师写一封英文推荐信，推荐你的同学王明。要点：1.推荐对象；2.推荐理由（学习、能力、品质）；3.希望考虑。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你校实验室需要一名学生助理，请你给李老师写一封英文推荐信，推荐你的同学王明。要点：1.推荐对象；2.推荐理由（学习、能力、品质）；3.希望考虑。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Mr. Li,\n\nI am writing to recommend my classmate Wang Ming for the position of student assistant in your laboratory.\n\nWang Ming is one of the most outstanding students in our class. He is always at the top of the class and has a solid foundation in computer science. More importantly, he is very skillful in programming and has won several prizes in coding competitions. Besides his excellent academic performance, he is careful, responsible and good at solving problems. In our group projects, he always finished his part on time and was willing to help others.\n\nI firmly believe that Wang Ming is the right person for this position. He will learn a lot from the work and make great contributions to the laboratory. I would appreciate it if you could consider my recommendation.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的李老师：\n\n我写信推荐我的同学王明担任您实验室的学生助理。\n\n王明是我们班最优秀的学生之一。他成绩总是名列前茅，计算机基础扎实。更重要的是，他编程能力很强，在编程竞赛中多次获奖。除了出色的学业成绩，他认真负责、善于解决问题。在小组项目中，他总是按时完成自己的部分，并且乐于帮助他人。\n\n我坚信王明是这个职位的最佳人选。他会从工作中学习很多，并为实验室做出贡献。如果您能考虑我的推荐，我将不胜感激。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["推荐信结构：推荐对象→理由→希望考虑","理由分层次：学业+技能+品质+实例","用竞赛奖项和项目经历佐证能力","结尾礼貌请求：I would appreciate it if you could consider my recommendation"]},{"id":37,"year":"2025","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文校园运动会通知","prompt":"学校将于下月举办秋季运动会，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.时间和地点；2.比赛项目；3.报名要求。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"学校将于下月举办秋季运动会，请你以学生会的名义写一份英文通知。要点：1.时间和地点；2.比赛项目；3.报名要求。词数100左右。","essay":"NOTICE\n\nTo promote physical fitness and enrich campus life, our school will hold the Autumn Sports Meeting next month.\n\nThe sports meeting will be held on the school playground from November 10th to November 12th. It includes various events, such as the 100-meter race, long jump, high jump, relay race and tug-of-war. Besides, a fun sports section with interesting games will also be arranged for everyone to enjoy.\n\nStudents who want to take part in the events should register with their class monitors before November 1st. Each student can sign up for at most two individual events. Please pay attention to your safety and warm up before the competitions.\n\nAll teachers and students are warmly welcome to watch the games and cheer for the athletes. Let's show our energy and team spirit together!\n\nThe Student Union","essay_cn":"通知\n\n为增强体质、丰富校园生活，我校将于下月举办秋季运动会。\n\n运动会将于11月10日至12日在学校操场举行。比赛项目包括100米赛跑、跳远、跳高、接力赛和拔河等。此外，还安排了趣味运动环节，让大家一起参与。\n\n想参加比赛的同学请在11月1日前到班长处报名。每位同学最多可报两个个人项目。请注意安全，比赛前做好热身。\n\n欢迎全体师生前来观赛，为运动员加油。让我们一起展现活力和团队精神！\n\n学生会","points":["通知要素齐全：目的、时间地点、项目、报名","项目列举+趣味环节体现全面","报名要求清晰（截止时间、项目数量限制）","安全提醒+加油号召体现组织者关怀"]},{"id":38,"year":"2025","type":"议论文","title":"论终身学习的重要性","prompt":"在知识快速更新的时代，终身学习越来越重要。请以Lifelong Learning为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.终身学习的必要性；2.如何做到终身学习；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"在知识快速更新的时代，终身学习越来越重要。请以《终身学习》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.终身学习的必要性；2.如何做到终身学习；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"Lifelong Learning\n\nWe are living in an age of knowledge explosion. New technologies appear every day, and what we learn at school will soon become out of date. Therefore, lifelong learning has become a necessity for everyone.\n\nWhy is lifelong learning so important? First, it helps us keep up with the development of society. For example, a computer programmer must learn new languages and technologies constantly, or he will be left behind. Second, lifelong learning can enrich our life and make us more competitive in the job market. Third, it is a way to keep our mind active and our life meaningful at any age.\n\nHow can we achieve lifelong learning? We can read books and articles every day, take online courses, and learn from people around us. The key is to keep curiosity and never stop asking questions.\n\nIn a word, learning is a lifelong journey, not a destination. As the saying goes, \"Live and learn.\" Only by learning all our life can we embrace a better future.","essay_cn":"终身学习\n\n我们生活在一个知识爆炸的时代。新技术日新月异，我们在学校学到的东西很快就会过时。因此，终身学习已成为每个人的必需品。\n\n为什么终身学习如此重要？首先，它帮助我们跟上社会的发展。例如，程序员必须不断学习新的语言和技术，否则就会被淘汰。其次，终身学习能丰富我们的生活，让我们在就业市场上更有竞争力。第三，它是让头脑保持活跃、让生活在任何年龄都有意义的方式。\n\n我们怎样才能做到终身学习？我们可以每天读书看报，上网络课程，向身边的人学习。关键是要保持好奇心，永不停止提问。\n\n总之，学习是一生的旅程，而不是终点。俗话说：「活到老，学到老。」只有终身学习，我们才能拥抱更美好的未来。","points":["时代背景引入（知识爆炸、技术更新）","必要性三层次：跟上社会/增强竞争力/充实人生","举例贴近专业（程序员学新技术）","谚语收尾：Live and learn + Only by...倒装"]},{"id":39,"year":"2025","type":"书信","title":"慰问信：慰问生病住院的同学","prompt":"你的同学小刚生病住院了，请你给他写一封英文慰问信。要点：1.表达关心；2.安慰他并给出建议；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你的同学小刚生病住院了，请你给他写一封英文慰问信。要点：1.表达关心；2.安慰他并给出建议；3.表达祝愿。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Xiao Gang,\n\nI was very sorry to hear that you are in hospital because of illness. I am writing to express my concern and best wishes for you.\n\nDon't worry too much about your health and study. The doctor said your illness is not serious, and you will recover soon if you follow the treatment. During your stay in hospital, please have a good rest, eat healthy food and take your medicine on time. Don't be anxious about the lessons you miss. Our teacher has promised to help you catch up when you come back, and I will share my notes with you every week.\n\nI know staying in hospital is boring, but think of it as a short holiday. I believe you will be back on campus very soon. If you need anything, just call me and I will be there.\n\nTake good care of yourself and get well soon!\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的小刚：\n\n听说你生病住院了，我很难过。我写信表达我的关心和最美好的祝愿。\n\n不要太担心你的健康和学习。医生说你病得不严重，只要配合治疗很快就会康复。住院期间，请好好休息，吃健康的食物，按时吃药。不要担心落下的功课。老师已经答应你回来后帮你补课，我也会每周把笔记分享给你。\n\n我知道住院很无聊，但把它想成一次短暂的假期吧。我相信你很快就会回到校园。如果需要什么，给我打电话，我会立刻出现。\n\n好好照顾自己，早日康复！\n\n你的朋友\n李华","points":["慰问信要点：得知消息→安慰→建议→祝愿","建议具体（休息、饮食、按时服药）","消除后顾之忧（补课、分享笔记）","温暖收尾：call me and I will be there"]},{"id":40,"year":"2025","type":"应用文","title":"写一封英文咨询信询问专升本政策","prompt":"你想了解专升本考试的相关政策，请写一封英文咨询信给学校招生办公室。要点：1.自我介绍和来意；2.询问具体问题（报考条件、考试科目、时间）；3.表达感谢。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你想了解专升本考试的相关政策，请写一封英文咨询信给学校招生办公室。要点：1.自我介绍和来意；2.询问具体问题（报考条件、考试科目、时间）；3.表达感谢。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Admission Office,\n\nI am Li Hua, a sophomore majoring in Computer Science. I am writing to ask for some information about the college entrance examination for undergraduates (specialist-to-undergraduate).\n\nI am determined to take the examination after I finish my three-year college study. However, I still have some questions about the policies. First, what are the requirements for applicants? For example, is there any restriction on the major or the school record? Second, which subjects will be tested? I have heard that the examination includes English, mathematics and computer knowledge, but I am not sure whether it is true. Third, when will the examination be held each year, and where can I find the latest information?\n\nI would be very grateful if you could answer my questions. Thank you for your time and help.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的招生办公室：\n\n我是计算机科学专业大二学生李华。我写信咨询专升本考试的相关信息。\n\n我决心在三年专科学习结束后参加专升本考试。但是，我对相关政策还有一些疑问。第一，报考条件是什么？例如，对专业或学业成绩有没有限制？第二，考哪些科目？我听说考试包括英语、数学和计算机知识，但不确定是否属实。第三，考试每年什么时候举行，在哪里可以找到最新信息？\n\n如果您能回答我的问题，我将不胜感激。感谢您的时间和帮助。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["咨询信结构：自我介绍→来意→具体问题→感谢","问题用First/Second/Third分层列出","问题具体且有依据（听说包括英语数学计算机）","结尾礼貌致谢：I would be very grateful if you could..."]},{"id":41,"year":"2025","type":"议论文","title":"论诚信的重要性","prompt":"诚信是中华民族的传统美德。请以The Importance of Honesty为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.诚信的意义；2.不诚信的危害；3.如何做到诚信。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"诚信是中华民族的传统美德。请以《诚信的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.诚信的意义；2.不诚信的危害；3.如何做到诚信。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Honesty\n\nHonesty is one of the most valuable virtues of the Chinese nation. It is the foundation of trust between people and the basic quality that everyone should have.\n\nHonesty plays an important role in our life. A honest person is always respected and trusted by others. In study, students who are honest in examinations can truly master knowledge. In society, businessmen who are honest can win more customers and develop their business better.\n\nOn the contrary, dishonesty brings great harm. If a student cheats in exams, he may pass the exam temporarily, but he will never learn real skills. If a company deceives its customers, it will lose their trust and finally fail in the market. Dishonest people may gain short-term benefits but lose long-term development.\n\nHow can we be honest? We should be honest in small things, such as returning what we borrow and admitting our mistakes. We should also say no to cheating in exams and fake products. Remember, honesty is the best policy. Only by being honest can we win trust, friendship and a bright future.","essay_cn":"诚信的重要性\n\n诚信是中华民族最宝贵的品质之一。它是人与人之间信任的基础，是每个人都应该具备的基本素质。\n\n诚信在我们的生活中发挥着重要作用。诚实的人总是受到他人的尊重和信任。在学习中，考试诚实的学生才能真正掌握知识。在社会中，诚实的商人能赢得更多顾客，把生意做得更好。\n\n相反，不诚信带来巨大危害。如果学生在考试中作弊，他可能暂时通过考试，但永远学不到真本领。如果公司欺骗顾客，就会失去信任，最终在市场上失败。不诚实的人可能获得短期利益，但失去长远发展。\n\n我们怎样才能做到诚信？我们应该在小事上诚实，比如归还借的东西、承认错误。我们还应该对考试作弊和假冒伪劣产品说不。记住，诚信是最好的策略。只有诚实，我们才能赢得信任、友谊和光明的未来。","points":["美德型议论文：意义→反面危害→践行方法","正反对比论证（honest vs dishonest）","诚信场景举例（考试、经商）贴近生活","谚语收尾：Honesty is the best policy + Only by...倒装"]},{"id":42,"year":"2025","type":"书信","title":"给外教写一封告别信","prompt":"你的外教Mr. White即将回国，请你写一封英文告别信。要点：1.表达不舍和感谢；2.回忆美好时光；3.送上祝福。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你的外教怀特先生即将回国，请你写一封英文告别信。要点：1.表达不舍和感谢；2.回忆美好时光；3.送上祝福。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Mr. White,\n\nI am writing to say goodbye to you. It is really hard for me to express my sadness that you are leaving us for your country.\n\nDuring the past two years, you have taught us not only English but also how to look at the world with an open mind. I still remember the first day when you came to our class, playing a funny game to make us relaxed. Your classes were always lively and interesting, and we learned a lot from your stories about your country. Thanks to your patient guidance, my oral English has improved greatly and I have become more confident in speaking.\n\nAlthough we are going to be far apart, your smile and your words will stay in my heart forever. I sincerely wish you a safe journey and a happy life in your homeland. I hope we can meet again someday.\n\nThank you for everything. Goodbye and take care!\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的怀特先生：\n\n我写信向您告别。得知您要回国了，我真的很难表达我的不舍。\n\n在过去两年里，您不仅教会我们英语，还教会我们以开放的心态看世界。我仍然记得您第一次来我们班时，玩了一个有趣的游戏让我们放松。您的课堂总是生动有趣，我们从您讲述的关于您国家的故事中学到了很多。多亏了您耐心的指导，我的英语口语进步很大，说话也更加自信了。\n\n虽然我们将相隔遥远，但您的笑容和话语将永远留在我的心里。我衷心祝愿您一路平安，回国后生活幸福。希望有一天我们能再次相见。\n\n感谢您所做的一切。再见，保重！\n\n您的学生\n李华","points":["告别信情感真挚：不舍+感谢+祝福","回忆具体细节（第一节课游戏、生动课堂）","成长对比（口语进步、更自信）体现教学成果","结尾温馨：your smile and your words will stay in my heart forever"]},{"id":43,"year":"2026","type":"议论文","title":"论大学生创业的利与弊","prompt":"越来越多的大学生选择自主创业。请以College Students' Entrepreneurship为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.创业的好处；2.创业的挑战；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"越来越多的大学生选择自主创业。请以《大学生创业》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.创业的好处；2.创业的挑战；3.你的看法。词数120左右。","essay":"College Students' Entrepreneurship\n\nWith the support of national policies, more and more college students choose to start their own businesses. However, entrepreneurship is a double-edged sword for young students.\n\nOn the one hand, starting a business has many benefits. It can help students put their knowledge into practice and develop abilities such as creativity, decision-making and teamwork. For example, a computer science student can start a small software company with his classmates, turning ideas into real products. Moreover, successful entrepreneurship can bring great economic returns and personal satisfaction.\n\nOn the other hand, college students face many challenges in entrepreneurship. First, they lack experience and social resources, so they may make wrong decisions. Second, they are short of funds, and bank loans are difficult for them to get. Third, running a business will take up much time and energy, which may affect their study.\n\nIn my opinion, students should be cautious about entrepreneurship. We should make a careful plan, learn from experienced people and balance business with study. If conditions are not ready, it is wiser to gain some work experience first and start a business later.","essay_cn":"大学生创业\n\n在国家政策的支持下，越来越多的大学生选择自主创业。然而，创业对年轻学生来说是一把双刃剑。\n\n一方面，创业有很多好处。它能帮助学生把知识付诸实践，培养创造力、决策能力和团队合作等能力。例如，计算机专业的学生可以和同学一起创办小型软件公司，把想法变成真正的产品。此外，成功的创业能带来可观的经济回报和个人成就感。\n\n另一方面，大学生创业面临许多挑战。第一，他们缺乏经验和社会资源，可能做出错误决策。第二，他们资金不足，也很难获得银行贷款。第三，经营企业会占用大量时间和精力，可能影响学业。\n\n在我看来，学生创业应该谨慎。我们应该制定周密的计划，向有经验的人学习，平衡好事业和学业。如果条件不成熟，先积累工作经验再创业是更明智的选择。","points":["热点话题：创业利弊分析","好处具体（专业知识落地、创业大赛案例）","挑战三点：经验/资金/时间","辩证结论：条件不成熟先积累经验更明智"]},{"id":44,"year":"2026","type":"书信","title":"邀请信：邀请老同学参加同学聚会","prompt":"你们班准备举办毕业三周年聚会，请你写一封英文邀请信给老同学。要点：1.聚会时间和地点；2.活动安排；3.期待参加。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"你们班准备举办毕业三周年聚会，请你写一封英文邀请信给老同学。要点：1.聚会时间和地点；2.活动安排；3.期待参加。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear classmates,\n\nHow time flies! It has been three years since we graduated from college. To review our friendship and share our life experiences, we are going to hold a class reunion on June 20th.\n\nThe party will be held at the Friendship Hotel, which is near our old campus, starting at 5:00 p.m. We have prepared a rich program: first, we will enjoy a big dinner together; then we will watch a video showing our old photos and funny moments; finally, everyone will be invited to share his or her life and work stories.\n\nSome of us are now working in different cities, so it is really a precious chance to meet again. Please reply to this email before June 10th to confirm whether you can come. If you have any special needs, just tell me and I will arrange them.\n\nI am looking forward to seeing all of you and reliving our happy college days!\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"亲爱的同学们：\n\n时间过得真快！我们从大学毕业已经三年了。为了重温友谊、分享生活经历，我们将在6月20日举办同学聚会。\n\n聚会将在母校附近的好友酒店举行，下午5点开始。我们准备了丰富的节目：首先一起享用丰盛晚餐；然后观看展示老照片和趣事的视频；最后每位同学都将分享自己的生活和工作的故事。\n\n我们中的一些人现在在不同的城市工作，所以这真的是难得的重逢机会。请在6月10日前回复此邮件确认能否参加。如果有特殊需要，告诉我，我会安排。\n\n期待见到大家，重温我们快乐的大学生活！\n\n你们的\n李华","points":["聚会邀请信：时间地点→活动安排→确认回复","活动安排用First/Then/Finally串联","强调意义（不同城市、珍贵重逢）","给出明确回复截止时间"]},{"id":45,"year":"2026","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文读书报告","prompt":"你读了一本英文书，请写一份英文读书报告。要点：1.书名和作者；2.内容简介；3.你的感受和推荐。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"你读了一本英文书，请写一份英文读书报告。要点：1.书名和作者；2.内容简介；3.你的感受和推荐。词数120左右。","essay":"Book Report: Who Moved My Cheese?\n\nLast month, I read an inspiring book called Who Moved My Cheese, written by Dr. Spencer Johnson. It is a short but thought-provoking story about four characters living in a maze and searching for cheese.\n\nThe book tells us that the \"cheese\" stands for the things we want in life, such as a good job, a happy family or success, while the \"maze\" represents the environment where we look for them. When the cheese moves, the little people and mice react differently: some refuse to change and starve, while others adapt quickly and find new cheese. The story teaches us that change is unavoidable, and only those who face it bravely and adjust themselves can survive and succeed.\n\nWhat impresses me most is the sentence, \"The more important your cheese is to you, the more you want to hold on to it.\" This book changed my attitude towards change and challenges. I strongly recommend it to everyone, especially to students who are facing the pressure of exams and the future. It is short enough to read in one evening but valuable enough to benefit you for a lifetime.","essay_cn":"读书报告：《谁动了我的奶酪？》\n\n上个月，我读了一本鼓舞人心的书，书名叫《谁动了我的奶酪？》，作者是斯宾塞·约翰逊博士。这是一个简短但引人深思的故事，讲的是四个角色生活在迷宫里寻找奶酪。\n\n书中告诉我们，「奶酪」代表我们生活中想要的东西，如好工作、幸福家庭或成功，而「迷宫」代表我们寻找这些东西的环境。当奶酪移动时，小矮人和老鼠的反应不同：有些拒绝改变而挨饿，有些则迅速适应并找到新奶酪。故事告诉我们，变化是不可避免的，只有勇敢面对并调整自己的人才能生存和成功。\n\n最令我印象深刻的是这句话：「奶酪对你越重要，你就越想抓住它。」这本书改变了我对变化和挑战的态度。我强烈推荐给所有人，尤其是正面临考试和未来压力的学生。它短得可以一晚读完，却宝贵得足以让你受益终生。","points":["读书报告格式：书名作者→内容简介→感受推荐","用比喻解读（cheese=目标、maze=环境）","对比角色反应引出主题","引用书中金句+结合自身+推荐理由"]},{"id":46,"year":"2026","type":"议论文","title":"论团队合作的重要性","prompt":"现代社会越来越强调团队合作。请以The Importance of Teamwork为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.团队合作的好处；2.举例说明；3.如何培养团队精神。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"现代社会越来越强调团队合作。请以《团队合作的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.团队合作的好处；2.举例说明；3.如何培养团队精神。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Teamwork\n\nIn modern society, teamwork has become more and more important. Whether in study, work or daily life, the spirit of cooperation is essential for us to achieve success.\n\nTeamwork has many advantages. First, when people work together, they can share ideas and combine their strengths, which often leads to better results than working alone. For example, in our software development course, our team of five students built a shopping website within a month. Each of us was responsible for a different part, such as designing, coding, testing and writing documents. Thanks to good cooperation, we finished the project on time and won the first prize.\n\nSecond, teamwork can improve our communication skills and widen our horizons, because we can learn from each other's different viewpoints. Third, it makes us realize the power of \"one plus one is greater than two\".\n\nHow can we develop the spirit of teamwork? We should learn to listen to others, respect different opinions and be willing to share. We should also be responsible for our own tasks and help teammates when they need us. In a word, teamwork makes the dream work. Only by working together can we go further.","essay_cn":"团队合作的重要性\n\n在现代社会，团队合作变得越来越重要。无论在学习、工作还是日常生活中，合作精神都是我们取得成功所必需的。\n\n团队合作有很多好处。首先，当人们一起工作时，他们可以分享想法、发挥各自的优势，往往比独自工作取得更好的结果。例如，在软件工程课上，我们五人小组在一个月内建成了一个购物网站。我们每人负责不同的部分，如设计、编码、测试和写文档。多亏了良好的合作，我们按时完成了项目并获得了第一名。\n\n其次，团队合作能提高我们的沟通能力，开阔视野，因为我们可以从彼此不同的观点中学习。第三，它让我们认识到「一加一大于二」的力量。\n\n我们怎样才能培养团队精神？我们应该学会倾听他人、尊重不同意见、乐于分享。我们还应该对自己的任务负责，在队友需要时帮助他们。总之，团队合作让梦想成真。只有一起努力，我们才能走得更远。","points":["论证结构清晰：好处→实例→培养方法","项目实例真实（五人开发网站、分工明确）","引用「一加一大于二」点题","金句收尾：Teamwork makes the dream work + Only by working together..."]},{"id":47,"year":"2026","type":"书信","title":"求职信：应聘IT公司实习生","prompt":"一家IT公司招聘暑期实习生，请你写一封英文求职信。要点：1.应聘职位；2.技能和优势；3.表达期望。词数100左右。","prompt_cn":"一家IT公司招聘暑期实习生，请你写一封英文求职信。要点：1.应聘职位；2.技能和优势；3.表达期望。词数100左右。","essay":"Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nI am writing to apply for the summer internship in software development advertised on your company's website.\n\nI am a junior college student majoring in Computer Science. During my two years of study, I have mastered Java, Python and database technology, and I have completed several course projects, including a library management system and a student information platform. Besides, I passed CET-4 and can read English technical documents fluently. What's more, I am hard-working, quick at learning new things and good at working in a team. Last summer, I did a part-time job as a website maintenance assistant, which gave me some practical experience.\n\nI am very interested in your company and eager to learn more about real-world software development. An internship in your company would be a great opportunity for me to improve my skills. I am available from July 1st to August 31st. I would appreciate it if you could give me a chance for an interview.\n\nLooking forward to your reply.\n\nYours faithfully,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的先生或女士：\n\n我写信申请贵公司网站上发布的软件开发暑期实习生职位。\n\n我是计算机科学专业的大专学生。在两年的学习中，我掌握了Java、Python和数据库技术，并完成了多个课程项目，包括图书馆管理系统和学生信息平台。此外，我通过了大学英语四级考试，能流利阅读英文技术文档。而且，我勤奋好学、接受新事物快、善于团队合作。去年暑假，我做了一份网站维护助理的兼职工作，积累了一些实践经验。\n\n我对贵公司非常感兴趣，渴望学习真实的软件开发。在贵公司实习将是我提升技能的大好机会。我7月1日到8月31日都有空。如果您能给我一个面试机会，我将不胜感激。\n\n期待您的回复。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["IT行业求职信：技能清单+项目经历+实习时间","技能具体（Java、Python、数据库）且有项目佐证","英语能力（CET-4、读英文文档）加分项","实习时间明确，结尾礼貌请求面试"]},{"id":48,"year":"2026","type":"应用文","title":"写一份英文活动总结报告","prompt":"你校上周举办了英语文化节，请你写一份英文活动总结。要点：1.活动概况；2.活动亮点；3.活动意义和展望。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"你校上周举办了英语文化节，请你写一份英文活动总结。要点：1.活动概况；2.活动亮点；3.活动意义和展望。词数120左右。","essay":"Summary of the English Culture Festival\n\nLast week, our school successfully held a three-day English Culture Festival. It was a great success and received warm welcome from all the students and teachers.\n\nThe festival included a variety of activities. On the first day, an opening ceremony was held in the lecture hall, where the headmaster delivered a speech in English. On the second day, an English singing contest and a dubbing competition took place, and the performers' wonderful shows won loud applause. On the last day, an English market was set up on the playground, where students could exchange books and handmade things in English.\n\nWhat impressed us most was the dubbing competition. Students chose their favorite movie clips and gave them new life with their voices, which was both funny and creative.\n\nIn my opinion, the festival not only improved our spoken English but also deepened our understanding of Western culture. It provided a good platform for us to show ourselves and build confidence. We hope that such a festival can be held every year and become a tradition of our school.","essay_cn":"英语文化节活动总结\n\n上周，我校成功举办了为期三天的英语文化节。活动取得了圆满成功，受到全体师生的热烈欢迎。\n\n文化节包括多种活动。第一天，开幕式在报告厅举行，校长用英语致辞。第二天，举行了英语歌唱比赛和配音比赛，选手们的精彩表演赢得了热烈掌声。最后一天，操场上设立了英语集市，同学们用英语交换书籍和手工作品。\n\n最令我们印象深刻的是配音比赛。同学们挑选最喜欢的电影片段，用声音赋予它们新的生命，既有趣又富有创意。\n\n在我看来，文化节不仅提高了我们的英语口语，还加深了我们对西方文化的理解。它为我们提供了展示自我、建立自信的良好平台。我们希望这样的文化节每年都能举办，成为学校的传统。","points":["总结报告格式：概况→亮点→意义展望","按时间顺序（第一天/第二天/最后一天）叙述","突出亮点（配音比赛）详略得当","结尾展望：become a tradition of our school"]},{"id":49,"year":"2026","type":"议论文","title":"论制定人生目标的重要性","prompt":"有些大学生缺乏明确的人生目标。请以The Importance of Setting Goals为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.目标的重要性；2.没有目标的危害；3.如何设定目标。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"有些大学生缺乏明确的人生目标。请以《设定目标的重要性》为题写一篇英语短文。要点：1.目标的重要性；2.没有目标的危害；3.如何设定目标。词数120左右。","essay":"The Importance of Setting Goals\n\nA life without goals is like a ship sailing without a compass. Goals give us direction, motivation and the power to overcome difficulties. Therefore, setting clear goals is of great importance, especially for college students.\n\nWith clear goals, we know what we are fighting for and how to arrange our time. For example, a student who dreams of becoming a software engineer will spend his spare time learning programming and doing projects, while a student without goals may waste his time on games and entertainment. Without goals, people often feel confused, idle and lack the motivation to move forward. As a result, they may achieve nothing and regret it in the future.\n\nHow should we set goals? First, our goals should be clear and specific, such as passing CET-4 this term or finishing a project before the holiday. Second, we should divide a big goal into small steps and complete them one by one. Third, we should write down our goals and review them regularly, so that we can keep making progress.\n\nIn a word, goals are like lighthouses on the sea of life. Set a goal, make a plan and take action. Only in this way can we realize our dreams and create a bright future.","essay_cn":"设定目标的重要性\n\n没有目标的人生就像没有指南针航行的船。目标给我们方向、动力和克服困难的力量。因此，设定明确的目标非常重要，尤其是对大学生来说。\n\n有了明确的目标，我们就知道自己为什么奋斗以及如何安排时间。例如，梦想成为软件工程师的学生会把业余时间用来学习编程、做项目，而没有目标的学生可能把时间浪费在游戏和娱乐上。没有目标，人们常常感到迷茫、无所事事，缺乏前进的动力。结果，他们可能一事无成，将来后悔。\n\n我们应该如何设定目标？首先，目标要清晰具体，比如这学期通过英语四级考试或假期前完成一个项目。其次，我们应该把大目标分解成小步骤，一步一步完成。第三，我们应该把目标写下来并定期回顾，这样就能不断进步。\n\n总之，目标就像人生海洋上的灯塔。设定目标，制定计划，付诸行动。只有这样，我们才能实现梦想，创造光明的未来。","points":["比喻开头：船与指南针、灯塔","正反对比（有目标vs无目标的学生）","目标设定三原则：具体/分解/回顾","首尾呼应（指南针与灯塔）"]},{"id":50,"year":"2026","type":"书信","title":"综合写作：给杂志社投稿分享学习英语的方法","prompt":"英语学习杂志向你约稿，请你写一封信并附上学习方法短文。要点：1.自我介绍和来意；2.分享有效的英语学习方法；3.祝愿杂志越办越好。词数120左右。","prompt_cn":"英语学习杂志向你约稿，请你写一封信并附上学习方法短文。要点：1.自我介绍和来意；2.分享有效的英语学习方法；3.祝愿杂志越办越好。词数120左右。","essay":"Dear Editor,\n\nI am Li Hua, an English learner from Yunnan. I am writing to share my experience in learning English, hoping that it can be helpful to other readers of your magazine.\n\nIn my opinion, interest is the best teacher. First, I develop my interest by watching English movies and listening to English songs. In this way, I can learn authentic expressions in a relaxing atmosphere. Second, I insist on memorizing ten new words every day and reviewing them in time, because vocabulary is the foundation of English. Third, I practice speaking English as often as possible, either in the English Corner or with my foreign friends online. Although I make mistakes sometimes, I never feel embarrassed, because mistakes are part of learning.\n\nThanks to these methods, my English has improved a lot, and I enjoy learning it more and more. I sincerely hope my experience can inspire more learners. I also wish your magazine greater success in the future.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essay_cn":"尊敬的编辑：\n\n我是来自云南的英语学习者李华。我写信分享我的英语学习经验，希望对贵刊其他读者有所帮助。\n\n在我看来，兴趣是最好的老师。首先，我通过看英文电影、听英文歌曲培养兴趣。这样，我可以在轻松的氛围中学到地道的表达。其次，我坚持每天背十个新单词并及时复习，因为词汇是英语的基础。第三，我尽可能多地练习说英语，无论是在英语角还是和外国朋友在线交流。虽然有时会犯错，但我从不觉得难为情，因为错误是学习的一部分。\n\n得益于这些方法，我的英语进步很大，我也越来越喜欢学英语。我真诚希望我的经验能激励更多学习者。我也祝愿贵刊越办越好。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n李华","points":["综合题型：信件+经验分享","方法三层次：兴趣/词汇/口语","金句：Interest is the best teacher","正视错误的态度（mistakes are part of learning）体现学习观"]}];
